# RepoAtlas - keep personal and generated files out of git.
# Push this folder as it is: the tool, the launchers and the docs are meant to be shared.

# Your own settings: your GitHub username, owner names and scan folders
03-my-settings/repoatlas.config.json
03-my-settings/findrepos.config.json
repoatlas.config.json
findrepos.config.json

# Generated reports: real repo names, folder paths, branch names and account names.
# This includes the shareable copy; share that file by hand, not through git.
04-reports/
repos.html
repos-shared.html
repoatlas-report.html
repoatlas-shared-report.html

# Remembered answers (which installs you declined)
repoatlas.state.json
findrepos.state.json

# Secrets and keys, in case a file lands in this folder by mistake
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*.token
credentials*.json
secrets*.json

# Operating system and editor leftovers
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/
